{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>eXoSpace Combat Engineer</strong> is inspired by Reassembly, FTL, Cosmoteer, Nova Drift, Starsector, Avorion and more. It fills a unique niche as a mission-based, gridless spaceship-designing roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/65c7e4a604377be895bc7e4c88bf631b.avif?t=1766066979\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.poster.avif?t=1766066979\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.webm?t=1766066979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.mp4?t=1766066979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easily snap modules into place</strong>\u00a0and quickly build your gunship or juggernaut. Improve your design using newly discovered modules. Balance thrusters, armor, weapons, shields, energy systems and even rotators and pistons to prepare for your next fight. Gridless building and loads of modules allow your destructive creativity to run wild! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/44d77c6e93e28b11d77c67e9100a47c9.avif?t=1766066979\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.poster.avif?t=1766066979\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.webm?t=1766066979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.mp4?t=1766066979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot your ship through explosive, physics-driven battles</strong>. Each mission starts with a fresh ship and a handful of blueprints, and your unlocked modules force you to adapt every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the unknown</strong>, push deeper into eXoSpace, and brave unpredictable encounters. Make friends and mortal enemies. Explode heroically, improve your design and try again. To succeed, you must defeat one of many brutal bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress</strong> through the ranks to access better starting ships, train your crew to improve your ship's performance, and unlock game-changing modifiers that change the game's rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b8ac12dbdcf6dfcaad94f988d03a5a47.avif?t=1766066979\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two missions are the same</strong>: randomized maps, enemies, events, and outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rank up</strong>\u00a0by completing missions to access new starting ships and increase your starting resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock game-changing modifiers and train your crew\u00a0</strong>using the bounties you collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox mode</strong> lets you freely build ships and command massive space battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of modules</strong> to discover, including pistons, rotators, and powerful unique parts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive modding support</strong> for ship modules, encounters, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Steam Workshop integration</strong> for sharing and downloading designs and mods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional <strong>Permadeath Mode</strong> for those who want the ultimate challenge where death is permanent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXoSpace is a passion project by Fantastimaker, an independent game studio consisting of just Bas, its developer, marketeer and designer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876200?t=1766066979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/6b852a33270fecc97c030861ae6899337f8900fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766066979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/0c6cb0eb4c88ca735407ea4aee052f591ef724c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766066979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/0c6cb0eb4c88ca735407ea4aee052f591ef724c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766066979","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3756720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>eXoSpace Combat Engineer</strong> is inspired by Reassembly, FTL, Cosmoteer, Nova Drift, Starsector, Avorion and more. It fills a unique niche as a mission-based, gridless spaceship-designing roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/65c7e4a604377be895bc7e4c88bf631b.avif?t=1766066979\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.poster.avif?t=1766066979\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.webm?t=1766066979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.mp4?t=1766066979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easily snap modules into place</strong>\u00a0and quickly build your gunship or juggernaut. Improve your design using newly discovered modules. Balance thrusters, armor, weapons, shields, energy systems and even rotators and pistons to prepare for your next fight. Gridless building and loads of modules allow your destructive creativity to run wild! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/44d77c6e93e28b11d77c67e9100a47c9.avif?t=1766066979\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.poster.avif?t=1766066979\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.webm?t=176