" ><strong>Extensive modding support</strong> for ship modules, encounters, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Steam Workshop integration</strong> for sharing and downloading designs and mods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional <strong>Permadeath Mode</strong> for those who want the ultimate challenge where death is permanent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXoSpace is a passion project by Fantastimaker, an independent game studio consisting of just Bas, its developer, marketeer and designer.</p>","developers":["Fantastimaker"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/8a8f9a6293c9d25b0929a9a4a1df6d7ca8af7d6c/header.jpg?t=1766066979","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 Bas @ Fantastimaker","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2876200/1264764620/29143f052648f472b0642c4bf94dbc164a23b0cd/1766065841/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766066977","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2876200/1264764620/29143f052648f472b0642c4bf94dbc164a23b0cd/1766065841/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766066977","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2876200/1264764620/29143f052648f472b0642c4bf94dbc164a23b0cd/1766065841/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766066977","id":257076738,"name":"eXoSpace Combat Engineer - Official Trailer","thum